<title>FINLAND: PSP UPS FINNISH '97 GDP GROWTH FORECAST TO 4.3 PCT.</title>
<headline>PSP UPS FINNISH '97 GDP GROWTH FORECAST TO 4.3 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned commercial bank Postipankki Oy on Thursday published revised forecasts for the Finnish economy, hiking its GDP growth forecast for 1997 to 4.3 percent from 3.8 percent in a previous forecast in February.  </p>
<p>Key figures in Postipankki's May forecast:</p>
<p>				1997     1998</p>
<p> GDP			  +4.3     +3.5</p>
<p> Exports		    +5.0     +5.0</p>
<p> Imports		    +4.0     +5.4</p>
<p> Private consumption    +4.0     +3.0</p>
<p> Investment		 +9.0     +7.0</p>
<p> C/A (FIM billion)     +17.6    +23.6</p>
<p> CPI			  +1.0     +1.6</p>
<p> Unemployment	     14.8     13.9</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
